    "site_desc": "The Silas Little flux tower is located in an upland, oak-pine stand in the New Jersey pine barrens. Disturbance history since the tower's establishment includes (1) spongy moth (Lymantria dispar) defoliation 2006-2008, (2) prescribed fires in 2019 and 2024, and (3) wind, snow storms, and drought.",
